    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving \u2014 new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving \u2014 new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "ZukuRace is a futuristic racing game with sim physics. You take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.",
